  "name": "forfettario-lawyer-cassa-forense",
  "description": "Worked example (g). Forfettario lawyer: fee €1,000.00 (N2.2); spese generali 15 % × 1,000.00 = €150.00; CPA (Cassa Forense, 4 %) on fee + spese generali 1,150.00 = €46.00; amount not subject to VAT 1,196.00 > 77.47, so €2.00 of stamp duty charged. Total 1,000.00 + 150.00 + 46.00 + 2.00 = €1,198.00; no VAT, no withholding. Countable revenue for the ceiling would be 1,152.00 (CPA excluded).",
